  {
   "slug": "bonus-listener-questions-live",
   "title": "Bonus: Listener questions, live from the studio",
   "date": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
   "excerpt": "Recorded in front of forty listeners: your questions about the show, our worst interview and the mystery noise in episode 9.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We invited forty listeners into the studio, handed them a microphone and let them ask anything. They did. This bonus episode is the result, lightly edited and full of laughter.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Yes, we finally explain the mystery noise in episode 9. No, it was not a ghost. It was much more embarrassing than a ghost.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Questions we answered</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>How do you find guests?</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>What was your worst interview?</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Do you ever disagree on air?</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>What is the mystery noise in episode 9?</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Can we visit the studio again?</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:studio-desk}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:studio-desk}}\" alt=\"A studio desk with two microphones, headphones and a mug\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:studio-desk}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The studio, tidied for once.</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The answer to the last question is yes. Watch the newsletter for the next live recording.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
